# The glass desert over the shoulder, at noon and at half past six (a low warm
# sun: eye_light 28 degrees with 75% of the day's light left), away from the
# sun and turned into it,
# with the frame cost over five seconds standing: before and after any change
# to how the glass is drawn.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/lands_glass.tour --seed=7 --weather=clear:0 --view=shoulder --stats
coast calm
hour 12
place typical_glass_desert
wait 3.0
shot noon with land:glass_desert
perf stats begin
wait 5.0
perf stats end glass-noon
hour 18.5
wait 2.0
shot low-sun with land:glass_desert
mouse 1400,0 1.0
wait 1.0
shot low-sun-toward with land:glass_desert
near boulder
wait 2.0
shot boulder with land:glass_desert
